cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below, and cite the SoccerMon dataset separately (see data/README.md)."
title: "Nested-model decomposition of next-day fatigue prediction in elite women's football"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for a nested-model analysis of what each class of athlete
  monitoring data adds over a persistence baseline when predicting next-day
  subjective fatigue. Uses the open SoccerMon dataset. Evaluated under nested
  cross-validation with player-wise grouping in both loops, with confidence
  intervals bootstrapped over players.
type: software
authors:
